---
/**
 * Scene 05: Research desk, on ink.
 * On wide screens Work 04 crawls into this ink (see crawl.ts): random spots
 * pixelate, then the dark grows out of the BacktestEngine terminal. The scene
 * pins and its headline rises through masks, like About's.
 * Shell only for now: the projects (solana-wallet-research's MCP replay and
 * calibration chart, EvenLighter in design) come next. Headline is draft copy.
 */
---

<section id="research" class="research" aria-labelledby="research-heading">
  <div class="research-inner">
    <p class="research-label type-label">(05) Research desk · Code private</p>
    <h2 id="research-heading" class="research-headline font-head font-bold">
      <span class="research-line">What I measure</span>
      <span class="research-line research-line--hot">before I trust it.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="research-note type-label">solana-wallet-research · EvenLighter, in design · In production</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .research {
    position: relative;
    /* Under the crawl layer (z 30), so it can rise unseen beneath the finished
       ink before taking over. */
    z-index: 10;
    min-height: 100svh;
    background: var(--color-ink);
    color: var(--color-cream);
    display: grid;
    align-content: center;
    padding: 6rem 1.25rem;
  }
  .research-headline {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6.4vw, 7.5rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }
  .research-line {
    display: block;
  }
  .research-line--hot {
    color: var(--color-signal);
  }
  .research-note {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .research {
      padding: 6rem 2rem;
    }
    /* Starts on grid column 3, like About's headline (12 columns, 1.25rem gaps). */
    .research-inner {
      margin-left: calc((100% - 11 * 1.25rem) / 6 + 2.5rem);
    }
  }
</style>
